          ],
          "text": "The United States argues that restitution under the mandatory statute should be ordered and does not violate the revenue rule."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "1108b87382a89de139f9d2461d909e551722930f25c6ef2a4d17434408e79b0d",
              "evidence_ids": [
