              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 39,
                "start": 39
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, absent clear congressional intent to override the revenue rule, statutes should not be interpreted to contravene it."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "1108b87382a89de139f9d2461d909e551722930f25c6ef2a4d17434408e79b0d",
