              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 40,
                "start": 40
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, there is no obligation for the United States to assist a foreign sovereign in enforcing its tax laws."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Respondent",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "1108b87382a89de139f9d2461d909e551722930f25c6ef2a4d17434408e79b0d",
